<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/Modality/noAssertion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The modality is not known or cannot be reasonably determined, or the creator has made no attempt to determine this field, or the creator has intentionally provided no information (no meaning shall be implied by doing so)."@en .
